{"seq":10,"slug":"ai-law-regulation","title":"AI 法律与监管","stage":"DONE","category":"law-legal","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.16,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-法律与监管-简介\">AI 法律与监管 简介</h1><p>人工智能技术的飞速发展正在深刻改变社会生产和生活方式，同时也对现有法律体系提出了前所未有的挑战。当算法作出影响个人权利的决策时，传统的法律责任框架如何适用？当 AI 系统产生创造性成果时，知识产权归属如何认定？当自动驾驶汽车发生事故时，责任应由谁承担？这些问题已从学术讨论进入立法实践。</p>\n<p>本知识库系统梳理 AI 法律与监管的核心议题，帮助读者建立对这一新兴领域的完整认知。与伦理治理不同，本知识库聚焦于具有法律约束力的制度框架、司法实践与合规要求。</p>\n<p><strong>第一章 AI 治理框架</strong>介绍全球主要经济体的 AI 监管格局，深入分析中国 AI 治理体系的制度逻辑，以及当前国际主流的基于风险分级的监管路径。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 AI 责任与权利</strong>探讨 AI 系统引发损害时的法律责任归属机制，分析算法歧视的法律规制路径，并讨论 AI 生成内容的知识产权争议。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 领域专项监管</strong>聚焦当前立法最为活跃的三个领域：生成式 AI 的内容监管、自动驾驶与自主系统的法律框架，以及 AI 在司法系统中的应用规范。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 合规实务</strong>面向实际操作层面，介绍 AI 影响评估方法、数据与 AI 合规的衔接框架，以及监管沙盒作为创新友好型监管工具的实践经验。</p>\n<p>建议具有法学基础或从事 AI 产品开发的读者按序学习，技术管理者可优先阅读第一章和第四章以建立监管全景认知。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-governance-frameworks","title":"AI 治理框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/ai-governance-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"global-ai-regulation-landscape","title":"全球 AI 监管格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/ai-governance-frameworks/global-ai-regulation-landscape"},{"seq":2,"slug":"china-ai-governance-system","title":"中国 AI 治理体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/ai-governance-frameworks/china-ai-governance-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-based-regulatory-approach","title":"基于风险的监管路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/ai-governance-frameworks/risk-based-regulatory-approach"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-liability-and-rights","title":"AI 责任与权利","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/ai-liability-and-rights","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-liability-attribution","title":"AI 责任归属","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/ai-liability-and-rights/ai-liability-attribution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithmic-discrimination-law","title":"算法歧视的法律规制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/ai-liability-and-rights/algorithmic-discrimination-law"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-intellectual-property","title":"AI 知识产权问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/ai-liability-and-rights/ai-intellectual-property"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"sector-specific-regulation","title":"领域专项监管","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/sector-specific-regulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"generative-ai-regulation","title":"生成式 AI 监管","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/sector-specific-regulation/generative-ai-regulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"autonomous-systems-law","title":"自动驾驶与自主系统法律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/sector-specific-regulation/autonomous-systems-law"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-in-judicial-system","title":"AI 司法应用规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/sector-specific-regulation/ai-in-judicial-system"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"compliance-and-practice","title":"合规实务","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/compliance-and-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-impact-assessment","title":"AI 影响评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/compliance-and-practice/ai-impact-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-and-ai-compliance","title":"数据与 AI 合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/compliance-and-practice/data-and-ai-compliance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-regulatory-sandbox","title":"AI 监管沙盒","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/ai-law-regulation/compliance-and-practice/ai-regulatory-sandbox"}]}]}